        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephanie Sigman, Benjamin Walker, Wyatt Russell, Rainn Wilson, Adam Pally, John Michael Higgins, Ron Livingston, Rob Corddry\n- Films: Pioneer, Spectre, Going Under, Shimmer Lake\n- Franchises: James Bond\n- Companies: Eon Productions, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, Columbia Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Stephanie Sigman appeared in the film \"Pioneer\" in 2013.\n- \"Spectre\" is the twenty-fourth spy film in the James Bond film series.\n- Eon Productions produced \"Spectre\" for Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer and Columbia Pictures.\n- Stephanie Sigman appeared in the film \"Spectre\" in 2015.\n- Stephanie Sigman appeared in the film \"Going Under\" in 2016.\n- Stephanie Sigman was listed as appearing in an unnamed 2017 film.\n- The film \"Shimmer Lake\" stars Benjamin Walker, Wyatt Russell, Rainn Wilson, Adam Pally, John Michael Higgins, Ron Livingston, Stephanie Sigman, and Rob Corddry.",
